<PageTitle>Developers - P1 Inventory</PageTitle><section class="public-page-head"><span class="eyebrow">DEVELOPERS</span><h1>Integrate inventory into your existing systems.</h1><p>Use scoped API keys and signed webhooks for reliable system-to-system automation.</p></section><section class="developer-block"><div><h2>REST API</h2><p>Products, inventory, purchasing and operations through versioned APIs.</p><pre><code>GET /api/v1/inventory?warehouse=WH-KL01</code></pre></div><div><h2>Webhooks</h2><p>Subscribe to inventory.updated, po.received and other operational events.</p><pre><code>inventory.updated\ntransfer.received\npo.received</code></pre></div></section>
